WEBVTT

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.360
<i>Hanamaru Kindergarten</i>

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.460
...and Tsuchi wouldn't stop looking at me.

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:35.900
What's wrong?

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.010
That person has been standing there this whole time.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:39.930
Now that you mention it...

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.750
Looks like he's glaring at something.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.220
Here.

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:49.470
Something's wrong with him.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:50.890
There certainly is.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:52.250
Could it be...?

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:54.150
What are you kids looking at?

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:59.060
Save me, Tsuchi! Somebody's after me!

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:01.540
Tsuchida-sensei, there's a suspicious guy.

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:06.160
Oh, him? He's nothing to worry about.

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:07.520
Why not?

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:08.550
Because...

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.470
Brother!

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:17.500
He's Koume's brother.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.920
"A Hanamaru Cheering Squad"

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:26.910
Shouldn't you be at school?

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:30.450
I have the day off, so I came to see how you were doing.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.430
Koume seems to be doing well.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:39.500
Yes.

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.030
She's so cute.

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.820
That's adorable, too.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.130
So is that.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.430
Adorable!

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:53.030
Is photography prohibited inside the kindergarten?

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:56.780
Oh, no. It's fine if you're just taking pictures of your sister.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.410
Koume's underwear is white!

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:05.720
Calm down! That's just a regular occurrence among the children!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.580
I know I worry too much.

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:13.880
She's just so timid, I can't help but be concerned.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:15.900
In fact, just yesterday...

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:19.650
"10th Hanamaru Kindergarten Field Day"

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.650
Your kindergarten's field day, huh?"

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.320
I should be able to cheer you on that day.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.370
You're coming to the field day?

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:28.910
I was thinking of going. Aren't you looking forward to it?

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:33.020
I'll probably be last place in the footrace.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:38.800
She seemed down for a while after that.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.740
So that's why you came here today.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.900
She is slow compared to the other children.

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:47.130
If she ends up in last place...

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:50.450
...I bet she'll cry!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.060
Listen...

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.740
Then she should practice running!

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:58.760
Koume...

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.120
You were listening?

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.360
It seemed like you were discussing something serious, so we were curious.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.700
I want to try practicing!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:11.800
Practice?

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:13.750
Good girl, Koume.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.340
You can do it!

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:16.020
Okay.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.350
You're going to need a coach.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.520
Huh? Me?

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:24.010
See you tomorrow.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:28.420
Sorry, I'm not exactly fast, either.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.380
Nice working with you!

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:35.520
You'll probably get a lot farther with Kusano-sensei.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:41.670
I heard you wanted to improve your running so your brother won't worry.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.790
That's great! That's fantastic!

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.410
Leave it to me.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.780
I'll make sure you take first place!

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:51.950
Go for the interscholastic competition!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.300
First place?

00:04:54.770 --> 00:05:00.040
Don't worry. Once you learn proper running form, you'll be much faster.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.260
Really?

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.170
Really.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.950
Let's get started!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.260
Let's start with swinging our arms while walking.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:10.360
Okay.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.960
Let's jog while focusing on swinging our arms.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.130
Okay.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.520
Now lean forward slightly and tuck your chin.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:21.680
Okay.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:25.080
That's it. Good job.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.980
Your field day is tomorrow.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:46.860
Yes. First through third place get medals.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:49.920
I wonder if I'll get a medal.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.060
Tomorrow's the real thing.

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:02.230
Run as fast as you can today.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.730
Make sure you don't hurt yourselves, though.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.380
Okay.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.920
It's Yu-kun and Kenji-kun!

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:26.230
You can do it, Yu-kun!

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:29.530
Aren't you going to cheer for Kenji-kun?

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:32.750
You can do it, Kenji-kun...

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:36.160
I can hear your words of encouragement, master!

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:38.980
Those words will lead me to first place!

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:51.160
This obstacle course is an easy victory.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.630
Good work, Hinagiku!

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:59.400
Go, go! Hinagiku!

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:03.450
Go, go! Hinagiku!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.760
Father, you stand out as is.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.610
Try to keep it down.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:10.560
Sorry.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.270
Sorry, miss!

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:19.490
The footraces will be starting soon.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.110
Gather up at the starting line.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:25.620
Give it your best shot, Koume-chan.

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:26.230
Okay.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.670
Koume-chan spent all afternoon practicing.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:34.080
Yes, she put a lot of effort into it.

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:36.230
She may actually take first place.

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.490
I practiced, too.

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:40.840
Toshiaki...

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:44.810
I'm just as slow as Koume-san...

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:48.070
...but nobody helped me.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:51.830
R-really? Sorry we didn't notice you.

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:56.720
It's fine. I know I don't stand out.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:59.640
But not today.

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:03.040
I will be the day's hero!

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:09.240
I was last after all!

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:10.800
Don't cry. You gave it your best shot.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:12.270
There's always next year.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.510
I've got to do it.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.300
Here we go.

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:47.690
Ready...

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:56.040
Koume-chan's first!

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:57.560
Koume!

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.330
I'm in first place.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:05.280
I really could get a medal.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:14.240
Koume!

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.170
Are you okay, Koume?

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:18.260
I'm fine.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:26.450
Koume...

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.130
You can do it!

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:35.310
You're almost there!

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:50.750
Koume-chan...

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:52.240
This must be...

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:58.650
Stop! Stop clapping!

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:09.650
Koume!

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:19.510
Over here, Koume.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.180
Brother...

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.580
Brother!

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:46.260
Good job. You made it all the way to the end.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:53.840
Nothing beats family.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.470
You're right.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:01.320
Look.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.290
I made it, so it doesn't look that great.

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:09.560
Here.

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:14.460
But I was last place.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:19.800
But you were first place in effort.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:22.720
Thank you!

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:28.290
You're surrounded by wonderful people, Koume.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:29.360
Yeah.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:37.310
I'll pull ahead of the pack at the next field day!

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:45.530
It's been a while since our last get-together.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.360
What shall we drink to?

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:50.590
Next week is Nishikaze-sensei's birthday!

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:54.970
Then let's drink to Nishikaze-sensei's birthday.

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:58.530
"A Hanamaru Confession"

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.120
Cheers!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.560
You read manga too, Yamamoto-sensei?

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:06.650
Yes, I borrowed something very interesting from my sister recently.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.070
It was called "Love Step."

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.920
Oh, "Love Step?"

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.540
Have you read it?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.980
Y-yes, I read it.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.770
I forgot what it's about. I'll have to read it again.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.550
What, are you saying it's our fault?

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:24.960
There are things even a teacher can't do.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.890
Yeah, that's right.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.330
That reminds me, I also...

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.530
What? What happened?

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:33.110
Kakogawa-sensei seems pretty drunk.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:36.770
Anyone who works will build up stress.

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:40.500
Our get-together is all about relieving stress.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:42.220
Stress, huh?

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:45.670
Tsuchida-kun, come over here.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:55.060
When you first came to the kindergarten, I thought you were useless.

00:12:56.910 --> 00:13:00.570
Well, you've finally gotten the hang of things.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:04.980
Well, we've got to get going.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.260
Take it easy.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.530
Let's go somewhere else.

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:12.530
"Karaoke Home"

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:31.560
Tsuchida-kun, you're a lucky man to have the company of three beautiful ladies.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:35.700
That's not all. He's even got Anzu-chan and Hinagiku-chan after him.

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:38.050
Tsuchida-kun sure is popular.

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:41.170
He doesn't have enough muscles for me.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:42.560
Muscle maniac.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:44.840
What was that, breast man?

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:47.770
H-how did you...?

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:49.110
I knew it!

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:50.860
I knew he was a breast man!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.960
Please don't say that in front of Yamamoto-sensei!

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.490
My, my...

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:58.940
Tsuchi, you've spilled something on yourself.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.790
"Tsuchi?" Yamamoto-sensei, are you drunk?

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.710
Let me wipe that up for you.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:05.090
Uh, sure. Thank you.

00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:07.910
Could it be?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.350
This could be it.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.980
Why don't you confess, Tsuchida-kun?

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:15.910
What's gotten into you?

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.730
You're a young man and woman in a cozy space.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:19.920
And you saw how Nana-chan is.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.340
This is your chance.

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.340
I can't do it.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.120
You can do it!

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:26.620
You'll be fine!

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.090
But I'm just...

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.430
There are tons of great things about you.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.410
Like what?

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.970
You watched that video with me.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.250
You call that good?

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:39.720
You really think I can do it?

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:40.770
You can!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.140
Do it!

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:48.650
Alright.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.590
I'll go with that line.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:53.970
Yamamoto-sensei...

00:14:55.780 --> 00:15:00.560
Will you let me stay by you during your hardest and happiest times?

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:08.460
You did it!

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.420
Good job!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:11.580
I did it!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:12.860
Good for you!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.870
You did it! You confessed!

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.690
You did it! You confessed!

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:26.460
You did it! You did it! You confessed!

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:29.900
You did it! You did it! You confessed!

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:33.260
You did it! You did it! You confessed!

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:36.640
You did it! You did it! You confessed!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.910
I did it!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:48.420
What's wrong, Tsuchida-sensei?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.720
You were late this morning. Did you stay up all night playing games?

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.400
I wish...

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.870
We'd be willing to listen if you'd like to share.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:02.280
Thanks. That means a lot.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.230
I see.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:13.750
I got drunk and confessed to Yamamoto-sensei, but I passed out before I got an answer.

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:17.800
I couldn't bear to see her this morning, so I was late.

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.630
That's no good.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.960
Cheer up, sensei.

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:23.970
Thank you.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:29.660
It would probably be best not to tell Anzu-chan about this.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.130
Right, of course.

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.580
Tsuchi!

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:38.150
I'm here, too!

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:41.370
Play house with us!

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:44.150
Tsuchi, you'll be my husband.

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:46.740
I'd like to be your wife, too.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.250
Why were you late this morning, Tsuchida-kun?

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.100
Kusano-sensei!

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:53.870
Was it because of what happened last night?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:54.820
Last night?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:55.640
What happened?

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:58.690
Last night was a lot of fun.

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:03.660
Kusano-sensei, did Yamamoto-sensei mention anything about last night?

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:06.690
I get the feeling I might not want to know, though.

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:08.380
Oh, about that?

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.820
We haven't discussed that this morning.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.150
I see...

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:15.570
"The Right Answer"

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:15.500
You've got to ask her yourself.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.610
What's the matter?

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:21.460
Yamamoto-sensei!

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:25.650
I, uh, still haven't gotten all the alcohol out of my system.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:28.480
How awful. Shall I get you some medicine?

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.920
Yes, please!

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:33.730
There she goes.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:35.670
You should just ask her, Tsuchida-kun.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:41.250
Something must have happened between Tsuchida-sama and Yamamoto-sensei yesterday.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.970
Do you know what happened, Kusano-sensei?

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:46.020
It's not a big deal.

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:47.680
What happened?

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:48.640
Please tell us!

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:52.120
It really isn't a big deal.

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:53.410
I still want to know!

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:57.080
Please don't say anything, Kusano-sensei. It will only make things more complicated.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:00.240
Well, I guess I'll tell you.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:04.530
Yesterday, Tsuchida-sensei confessed to Yamamoto-sensei.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.350
She said it.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.500
Tsuchi...

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.750
He confessed to Yamamoto-sensei...

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:19.190
He might have confessed, but that doesn't mean they're dating.

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:23.420
Yamamoto-sensei hasn't responded yet.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.420
She hasn't responded yet.

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:28.300
And based on her attitude just now...

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:30.560
Uh, you two...

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:34.860
I can't believe she would turn down a wonderful man like you.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:38.530
Yamamoto-sensei has no taste in men.

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:42.740
You might be good looking, but Yamamoto-sensei is out of your league.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.700
She turned me down? She's out of my league?

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.480
I'll always be by your side.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.850
Cheer up, Tsuchida-sama.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.630
I'm here for you.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.040
Is this a happy ending?

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:59.130
I don't think this is over yet.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.690
What am I going to do?

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.640
That's beautiful, Yamamoto-sensei.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.180
Let me see.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.360
I'm curious, but I can't go in there.

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:14.060
Are you going to get married, Yamamoto-sensei?

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.250
Y-you're getting married, Yamamoto-sensei?

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:22.030
No, we were just looking at some photographs.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:24.840
Photos?

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:29.290
I went to my friend's fitting.

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.280
While I was there, I got to try it on.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.670
She's beautiful...

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:34.400
You look great.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:34.950
She really is beautiful.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.010
Really?

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:35.670
Yes.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.720
You look great.

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:41.170
Maybe someday I'll get to wear my own wedding dress.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.090
Tsuchida-sensei...

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.310
I can't let anyone take this girl from me.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:54.600
Yamamoto-sensei, do you remember what I told you yesterday?

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.240
Please give me an answer.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:02.970
I love it, too.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.250
That line...

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:11.370
"Love Step"

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:10.160
...is from that famous scene in "Love Step," isn't it?

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:14.480
I love that line, too.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:21.060
I was so happy to see you perform that line as though you were acting in a drama.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:26.620
I wish someone would say that to me.

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:28.760
But I did...

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.630
I want to read that manga, too.

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:32.730
Me, too.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:34.890
Okay, I'll let you borrow it some time.

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:38.670
Th-that's right. I had forgotten.

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:42.960
She's unbelievably unperceptive!

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:47.960
I'm such a fool.

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:51.350
Don't worry about it. It's not as though she rejected you.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:53.490
I haven't even gotten far enough to be rejected!

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:57.990
She may never even notice what I'm trying to do.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.430
Damn it!

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:06.890
Sorry you have to eat convenience store sandwiches.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.400
I love sandwiches.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:13.400
Once I finish this job, I'll make proper meals.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:23.230
Tsuchi? You stink of alcohol.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.900
He must have drank too much and passed out.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:28.860
He woke up.

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:31.890
Sakura-senpai...

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:33.280
Good morning.

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:35.560
Are you okay, Tsuchi?

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:40.550
I can't do it. I can't go on.

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:45.250
I don't know what happened to you, but that's life.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:47.540
I don't want to go to kindergarten.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:49.420
Maybe I'll quit my job.

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:53.580
It doesn't matter if I quit working at the kindergarten.

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:57.390
Don't quit your job!

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:32.160
Ouch...

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:33.250
Tsuchida here.

00:23:33.250 --> 00:23:35.230
Sakura-senpai hasn't changed a bit.

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:36.630
I guess I'm the one at fault today, though.

00:23:36.630 --> 00:23:38.290
I'll give it my best starting tomorrow.

00:23:38.290 --> 00:23:40.390
You're next, Anzu!

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:41.790
Got it!

00:23:41.790 --> 00:23:44.750
Next week's episode is about a pushy wife and a Hanamaru story. Don't miss it!

00:23:42.260 --> 00:23:43.490
"A Hanamaru Wife"

00:23:43.490 --> 00:23:44.750
"A Hanamaru Story"

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:49.520
"See you next time!"
